[h1]Less Map Markers[/h1]

[b]Up to date for game version 1.2.x[/b]

Less Map Markers reduces map-marker clutter by hiding most non-player country markers while keeping your own markers visible.

[h2]Behavior[/h2]

The mod filters major map-marker setting categories through the in-game GUI layer:

[list]
[*]City markers
[*]Market markers
[*]Raw goods markers
[*]Import/export markers
[*]Blocked vision markers
[*]Building, army, navy, and conquistador construction markers
[*]Fort and toll markers
[/list]

These markers remain visible when they belong to your country and are hidden when they belong to other countries.

The mod avoids gameplay script changes and does not alter unit, combat, siege, or cabinet-action logic.
